# What the container build does not need.
#
# The API image is built from the workspace manifests and the three trees it
# actually imports, so everything else is noise: the web bundle, the Android
# project, test fixtures, recordings and local notes.

node_modules
*/node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
apps/web
apps/android
android
docs
scripts
tests
incoming_files
tmp
.git
.github
*.apk
*.aab
*.log
